# Secrets for your own copy of the KC 311 web server.
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for these. For `npx wrangler dev`, copy
# this file to .dev.vars and fill it in.

# The owner token. Anyone with it can make invites, pause the server, and set
# the city key, so make it long and random (for example: openssl rand -base64 24).
ADMIN_TOKEN=
